{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118203155520-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118211828\"/><p>事發利興樓一單位。</p><p>今午(18日)2時13分，馬鞍山利安邨利興樓一單位，姓甘(55歲)男子的家人報案，指懷疑他在上址暈倒。消防到場破門入屋，經檢查證實事主已經死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.903893+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:31:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:21.205591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:56.587866+00:00","content_hash":"79f3301bbdbea5e5ff0925cb7b28634000d7f90b8242887ed6b98ff72986a54a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.903893+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}